Looping Through Rows and Seats

An array is created to represent the rows, and a loop is used to iterate through each row.
A nested loop is implemented to create individual seats within each row, which can be complex for beginners.

Using forEach Loop

The forEach method is introduced to work with arrays, allowing a function to process each row.
The content also mentions the possibility of using arrow functions for a more modern syntax, which will be covered later.
